  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v4.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "af2b92056ca31a7220990e54bbd1bbedbc57bc2b4f1144bf07985981269a0793",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a37c9bbe445cd4e3e1b7939397032495334620a00e4c5f41a2084281eae2c7e7",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nSlippy-Slide\nSkates",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "336942814a6f66ab6bfbe461474873e2ce719a778779c5416c00c944e7f7c5bd",
      "text": "Wukong watched them glide.\n“Look! Flying feet!”\n“I want to try!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "756eabdd7baa56289a5ba6020d51130f7b324a044cfc51931ebc974d60556ab0",
      "text": "He put on his skates.\nClomp. Clomp.\n“My feet have tiny sleds!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0c3ceb05fb024bf7cc6cfb3d8db2d5e060f686f700a30b564c8de53521d6fcb7",
      "text": "Helmet on. Mittens on.\nCoach Otter checked\nhis skates.\n“Ready for little steps?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3956085b073339e9c07beff33384addeae69bf21732cbc800fa8d5d45e58e22f",
      "text": "Wukong stepped onto the ice.\nHis feet slid apart.\n“Wait for me, feet!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "225146395f24a02d327d4a17370cf334e61ee276ac66c889b8ae7fb5d85641ff",
      "text": "Whoops! Down he went.\nHis bottom met the ice.\n“Hello, chilly floor.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "97da6c329eb9f449cd2b450c2e8c8984bd7f4611fca345d1d080bd06f523cba8",
      "text": "“Learning takes practice,”\nsaid Coach Otter.\n“Let’s get up together.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0bd441cfb14feaa0988a8b30b885a3c56470003cf5adbf7ab40fe831102165ee",
      "text": "Little steps. Bent knees.\n“Like a penguin!” said Rabbit.\nWukong waddled and giggled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "77d3870fccd29ebaa42dab4a06594a20654dea46c9c1cff50bf8453cef410b9c",
      "text": "Push… glide.\nPush… glide.\nOne tiny slide!\nThen another.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "88cf8ddbef04b44933a82a74c5cbdbef6d1988c1e1f8c74b2f62577acafbabf0",
      "text": "Then came another tumble.\n“I thought I had it.”\nHe sat beside Pigsy.\n“Rest with me,” said Pigsy.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bc98d615d354525d5c5261c2bdb9b5f0a0e4becedcc6ec13a23af1f9e8e940bc",
      "text": "They warmed their paws.\nThey watched\nthe swirling snow.\n“I’ll try again,” said Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a18a769204b47d7e1a8717a311e9563850d78ecc831c4b4e541beb327bc9e9a9",
      "text": "He came back to practice.\nA little step. A little glide.\nWobbles and all.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "02fd1caf3adcce565749478a19d90d63b331f9090b52ab2a93dca8e1c3d36648",
      "text": "Then his feet found a rhythm.\nPush… glide.\nPush… glide.\n“Look! I’m doing it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fa9ea9a746164e628ae8f5546e060bfe3045a1143943e7bf8a79ce65a6bb61dc",
      "text": "They made a gentle circle.\nRabbit led. Pigsy followed.\nWukong glided along.\nSix happy skates!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2c4470712894fc02af84922f7e39014927a99ccc9f5eab4e5bfe6fb3e9cc44ee",
      "text": "The rink lights twinkled.\n“See you soon, ice!”\nHis feet were tired.\nHis smile was not.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f21157a30c64576bdc8e6aae60ebe7dbb25e02d7dcad5e8d3b8968f9ba695bfb",
      "text": "Wukong curled under his quilt.\nIn his dreams,\nhe glided past the stars.\nSlowly. Softly.\nAll the way to sleep.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
